{"text":"His brother is a construction worker, earning his daily wage. And his father works as a stone layer farther away, but sends home what little he makes so Vishal can go to school. And Vishal loves math, and mostly he studies. And when he's not studying, he likes watching kubudi. And he dreams of someday joining the Indian Armed Forces. And we're grateful that Vishal and his family joined us today. We're very proud of him, because he's an example of the talent that's here. And Vishal's dreams are as important as Malia and Sasha's dreams, our daughters. We want him to have the same opportunities. Sisters and brothers of India. Now, we are not perfect countries, and we've known tragedy, and we've known triumph.","words":[{"text":"His","start":0.0,"end":0.46},{"text":"brother","start":0.46,"end":0.68},{"text":"is","start":0.68,"end":0.88},{"text":"a","start":0.88,"end":0.98},{"text":"construction","start":0.98,"end":1.4},{"text":"worker","start":1.4,"end":1.88,"punct":","},{"text":"earning","start":1.88,"end":2.14},{"text":"his","start":2.14,"end":2.44},{"text":"daily","start":2.44,"end":2.68},{"text":"wage","start":2.68,"end":3.02,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":3.7,"end":3.84},{"text":"his","start":3.84,"end":3.94},{"text":"father","start":3.94,"end":4.18},{"text":"works","start":4.18,"end":4.46},{"text":"as","start":4.46,"end":4.66},{"text":"a","start":4.66,"end":4.88},{"text":"stone","start":4.88,"end":5.1},{"text":"layer","start":5.1,"end":5.36},{"text":"farther","start":5.36,"end":6.12},{"text":"away","start":6.12,"end":6.48,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":6.6,"end":6.78},{"text":"sends","start":6.78,"end":7.6},{"text":"home","start":7.6,"end":7.84},{"text":"what","start":7.84,"end":8.0},{"text":"little","start":8.0,"end":8.16},{"text":"he","start":8.16,"end":8.32},{"text":"makes","start":8.32,"end":8.52},{"text":"so","start":8.52,"end":8.74},{"text":"Vishal","start":8.74,"end":9.04},{"text":"can","start":9.04,"end":9.3},{"text":"go","start":9.3,"end"